# --- Local caches / regenerable scratch (see docs/LOCAL_CACHE.md) ---
# Prefer OUT under .testbeds/active (or .testbeds/ci-smoke); root .ci-testbeds* is legacy.
# Intentional fixtures stay under testdata/minimal-testbeds/ and testdata/bench-comparison/.
# Clean: scripts/testbeds-clean.sh [--force] (never deletes .eval-projects or testdata/).
# Rebuild: scripts/testbeds-all.sh prepare | ci-prepare-minimal-testbeds.sh | prepare-oss-testbeds.sh
# Re-index a bed: codehelper analyze (or watch --daemon).

